exports[`Notice template renderers > renders gambling-agc-new 1`] = `
"GAMBLING ACT 2005
APPLICATION FOR A NEW ADULT GAMING CENTRE PREMISES LICENCE

Sample Gaming Ltd has applied to Sample Licensing Authority for an Adult Gaming Centre premises licence at Sample Betting Shop, 12 Market Street, Sampleton LS1 1AA. Proposed hours: Mon–Sun 09:00–22:00.

The application can be inspected at Licensing Authority, Town Hall, Sampleton LS1 2BB during Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm.

Any representations must be made in writing to Sample Licensing Authority at Licensing Authority, Town Hall, Sampleton LS1 2BB or licensing@sample.gov.uk by 2025-11-11."
`;

