exports[`Notice template renderers > renders gvol-new 1`] = `
"GOODS VEHICLE (OPERATOR'S) LICENCE

Sample Haulage Ltd trading as Sample Logistics of Logistics House, Manchester M1 1AA is applying for a Standard National operator's licence in the North Western Traffic Area.

Proposed operating centre: Unit 5 Industrial Estate, Manchester M1 1AA.
Authorisation: 6 goods vehicles and 4 trailers.

Owners or occupiers of land (including buildings) near the operating centre who believe that their use or enjoyment of that land would be affected may make representations to Traffic Commissioner, North Western Traffic Area, Springfield House, Warrington WA1 1AB by 2025-11-09.

Representations must be made in writing. Representors must at the same time send a copy to the applicant at the address given above."
`;

exports[`Notice template renderers > renders gvol-variation 1`] = `
"GOODS VEHICLE (OPERATOR'S) LICENCE — VARIATION

Sample Haulage Ltd trading as Sample Logistics of Logistics House, Manchester M1 1AA has applied to vary the operator's licence in the North Western Traffic Area as follows: Increase authorisation by two vehicles at Unit 5 Industrial Estate..

Operating centre: Unit 5 Industrial Estate, Manchester M1 1AA.
Authorisation after variation: 6 goods vehicles and 4 trailers.

Owners or occupiers of land (including buildings) near the operating centre who believe that their use or enjoyment of that land would be affected may make representations to Traffic Commissioner, North Western Traffic Area, Springfield House, Warrington WA1 1AB by 2025-11-09.

Representations must be made in writing. Representors must at the same time send a copy to the applicant at the address given above."
`;

exports[`Notice template renderers > renders licensing-club-new 1`] = `
"LICENSING ACT 2003
