exports[`Notice template renderers > renders licensing-premises-new 1`] = `
"LICENSING ACT 2003
APPLICATION FOR A NEW PREMISES LICENCE

Notice is hereby given that Sample Bars Ltd trading as Sample Lounge has applied to Sample Borough Council for a new premises licence for Sample Venue, 10 High Street, Sampleton SW1A 1AA.

Licensable activities applied for: Sale of alcohol (on the premises); Live music.
Proposed hours: Mon–Sat 10:00–23:00; Sun 12:00–22:30. Opening hours: Daily 10:00–00:00. The proposed designated premises supervisor is Jane Doe.

The application can be inspected at Licensing Team, Civic Centre, Sampleton during Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm or online at https://sample.gov.uk/licensing/register.

Any representations must be made in writing to Sample Borough Council at Licensing Team, Civic Centre, Sampleton SW1A 2BB or licensing@sample.gov.uk by 2025-11-11.

It is an offence to knowingly or recklessly make a false statement in connection with an application; a person guilty of such an offence is liable on summary conviction to a fine."
`;

