exports[`Notice template renderers > renders planning-conservation 1`] = `
"PLANNING (LISTED BUILDINGS AND CONSERVATION AREAS) ACT 1990
APPLICATION REFERENCE: SCC/2025/1234 — AFFECTS A CONSERVATION AREA

Sample Developments Ltd has applied to Sample City Council for Construction of a mixed-use development comprising 80 dwellings, retail space, and public realm improvements. at Riverside Way, Sample City EC1A 1BB, which is within/affects a Conservation Area.

Details can be viewed at Civic Offices, Sample City EC1A 2CC or online at https://planning.sample.gov.uk/register. Comments must be submitted via the online portal to Sample City Council at Planning Department, Civic Offices, Sample City EC1A 2CC / planning@sample.gov.uk / https://planning.sample.gov.uk/applications/123456 by 2025-11-09."
`;

