exports[`Notice template renderers > renders probate-trustee-s27 1`] = `
"TRUSTEE ACT 1925, SECTION 27
ESTATE OF John Sample (also known as Johnny Sample)
Last address: 50 Sample Road, Sampleton SW1A 4AA — Date of death: 2025-08-30

NOTICE is hereby given that any persons having claims against or an interest in the estate of the above-named deceased should send particulars of their claims to Jane Sample (Executor) / Sample Solicitors LLP at 100 Legal Street, Sampleton SW1A 2ZZ quoting reference JS/2025/EST not later than 2025-12-16.

After this date the estate may be distributed having regard only to the claims of which notice has been received."
`;
